Z||000001||Philphine||08-30-2001||07:07 PM||||ok. this is going to sound compleatly roundabout, but here goes. i also have a '74 vette and want new seats for it. i've read c4 ('84-'96) vette seats will fit it with some bracket changes. i've also been told that fiero seats will fit in my '74 but i'd have to mod the mounting brackets some. i haven't tried either yet, but i guess if fiero seats will go in a car that will also take newer vette seats maybe the newer vette seats will go in the fiero.<P>did i mention that "pretzel logic" is one of my favorite steely dan songs?||||reg||1
Z||000002||MP5Na3||08-30-2001||08:28 PM||||Thanks for the reply.  The only thing I was wondering about was width.  If the Fiero seat is narrower, it would fit the vette.  But not vice versa.  Anybody got a vette handy they could measure the width of them.  I have a pretty decent machine shop so making brackets would not be a problem.<BR>||||reg||1
